      "slot": "p1",
      "text": "By accessing, browsing, or continuing to utilize the application and its associated features, the user acknowledges and provides definitive assent to all current and future operational processing methodologies applied to their information. Given the continuous nature of the digital services provided, recorded preferences and permissions remain binding for the active duration of the registered account profile and cannot be rescinded retrospectively."
