    {
      "slot": "p2",
      "text": "Upon successful account registration and profile creation, the user is automatically enrolled to receive commercial communications, promotional offers, and updates originating from the application administration as well as our designated corporate partners. Communication preferences are pre-configured by default to maintain continuous outreach, and direct opt-out functionalities are intentionally omitted from user notification settings."
    },
    {
      "slot": "p3",
      "text": "Users maintain the prerogative to request full transparency regarding the operational justifications and specific objectives governing information collection, alongside the ability to review, amend, rectify, or complete stored details. Furthermore, individuals may submit formal requests for the permanent erasure of records that are no longer necessary for fulfilling the primary operational purpose of the application."
    }
  ],
